<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/camel-trek.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Off the beaten path · Itinerary</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Camel Trek in the Northern Frontier</h1>
      <div class="itin-meta reveal">
        <span><b>3 days · 2 nights</b></span>
        <span>Samburu · Northern Kenya</span>
        <span>Walking safari</span>
        <span>from <b>$1,550</b> / person</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a href="contact.html?trip=Camel%20Trek%20in%20the%20Northern%20Frontier" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this escape</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="index.html#experiences">Off-beat escapes</a> / Camel Trek in the Northern Frontier</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">Slow right down to the pace of a camel. In Kenya's wild northern frontier you walk with Samburu warriors and their camels through acacia country, far from any road or crowd, and sleep out under a sky thick with stars.</p>
        <p>A soulful, screen-free reset for the adventurous — the camels carry the camp, you carry nothing but a daypack, and the silence does the rest.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your escape</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Fri</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Into the frontier</h3><p>Fly north to Samburu country and meet your guides and camels. A gentle first walk into the bush to your fly-camp, then a fireside dinner under the stars.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Mobile fly-camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Sat</div><div class="day__body"><h3>A day on foot</h3><p>Walk with the camels through dry riverbeds and acacia woodland, tracking wildlife and learning the bush from the Samburu. A long lunch in the shade, then a new camp as the light turns gold.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Mobile fly-camp · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Sun</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Last walk &amp; fly home</h3><p>A cool dawn walk, breakfast in the bush, then the flight back south — dusty, unplugged and quietly transformed.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="incl reveal">
        <div class="section__head section__head--left"><p class="eyebrow">All taken care of</p><h2 class="section__title">What's included</h2></div>
        <ul class="incl__grid">
          <li>Return flights to the north &amp; transfers</li>
          <li>Two nights mobile fly-camping</li>
          <li>Camels, handlers &amp; Samburu guides</li>
          <li>All camp staff, tents &amp; bedrolls</li>
          <li>All meals &amp; bush dining</li>
          <li>Conservancy &amp; community fees</li>
          <li>24/7 Rendile concierge</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1.2rem;color:var(--ink-soft)">From <strong>$1,550 per person sharing</strong>; <strong>resident rates available</strong>. A moderate level of fitness helps, but you walk at your own pace and can ride the camels too. Best in the cooler, drier months.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

