    <div class="container reveal"><h2>Walk the wild north.</h2><p>Tell us your dates and group and we'll arrange the camels, guides and camps.</p><a href="contact.html?trip=Camel%20Trek%20in%20the%20Northern%20Frontier" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this escape</a></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
